# Belt-and-suspenders: this harness writes ALL scratch OUTSIDE the tree by
# default — VM overlay disks, the cloud-init seed.iso, downloaded cloud images,
# built release blobs, serial-console logs, and the throwaway test minisign key
# live under PPR_DIR (default /var/tmp/ppr) and OUT (default $TMPDIR/ppr-stage3).
# These patterns only matter if someone repoints PPR_DIR/OUT into the tree: run
# artifacts and keys must never be committed. The scripts + README below are the
# only tracked files here.
*.img
*.qcow2
*.iso
*.fd
*.log
*.key
*.pub
*.minisig
sha256sums.txt*
rel/
stage3/
hang/
ppr/
_artifacts/
